<title>NETHERLANDS: NAEFF 1996 NET RISES, DIVIDEND UNCHANGED.</title>
<headline>NAEFF 1996 NET RISES, DIVIDEND UNCHANGED.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     3.3  vs   2.6</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		 35.00 vs  35.00</p>
<p>NOTE - Plastics processing group Naeff NV said its 1996</p>
<p>turnover had risen by about eight percent but did not give any</p>
<p>further details.</p>
<p>The company previously expected the 1996 turnover to grow by</p>
<p>about five percent.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
